  1036 000004A9 51                  <1>         push    ecx                     ; lpNumberOfBytesWritten
  1037 000004AA 6A01                <1>         push    1
  1038 000004AC 52                  <1>         push    edx
  1039 000004AD FF7552              <1>         push    dword [V(v_outh)]
